# Vercel Serverless Function Exclusion List
# Keeps the AWS Lambda bundle well below the strict 250 MB uncompressed limit.
# Root requirements.txt contains heavy torch/cv2 for Docker/Render;
# Vercel uses api/requirements.txt instead.
/requirements.txt
/models/
*.pt
*.mp4
/Dataset/
/data/
/docs/
/tests/
/var/
/.github/
/.agents/
/.superpowers/
/Literature/
*.tmp
*.log


